    <title>Project ideas for Summer of Code 2014</title>
    <link>http://blog.queze.net/post/2014/01/24/Project-ideas-for-Summer-of-Code-2014</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">urn:md5:af675d129228806406dd5c38774af9a4</guid>
